WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.738
For each patient the inner query searches lab
results for the same patient ID It

00:00:06.764 --> 00:00:12.585
looks for any result outside the normal range We do
not need a count

00:00:14.303 --> 00:00:19.966
We only need at least one abnormal row That makes
EXISTS a direct

00:00:19.979 --> 00:00:25.893
match for the question Run the query and identify
the patients that satisfy

00:00:25.919 --> 00:00:26.617
the condition
